description:
[Game reference] Horses: breeds, gaits, stamina, food, saddles, shoes, armour, stables, decay, towing. Everything on rust.wiki/horses. `breeds` (as `/horses/breeds`); `gaits` (top speed and stamina per gait); `stamina`
(max 60, gallop cost, road/swim factors, regen, how food raises it); `gear` (each saddle/shoe/armour/saddlebag: gallop speed
change, storage, scrap price at the Stables, recipe, `horse_taken`/`rider_taken` = % of each damage type that gets through;
`protection_note`: without armour a horse takes full damage in game - the prefab's resistances are wiped by the server);
`foods` (per food: `stamina_core` added, `heal`, `dung`, boosts); `stables`, `spawn` (wild horses: biomes, per km²);
`decay`, `dung`, `towing`, `convars`, `rules` (code facts: no breeding, breed stamina unused...). section= keeps it short (gear, food, stamina, getting, care, settings, breeds, gaits). Link https://rust.wiki/horses.
